<section id="simulating-a-year-of-incidents" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="simulating-a-year-of-incidents">Simulating a year of incidents</h2>
<p>Real call volume usually bottoms out around 4–5 AM and peaks in the late afternoon. We simulate that shape, then give each call a response time that gets a little slower during busy hours, when more units are already committed.</p>
